  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The purpose of this study was to improve our current understanding of green alder shrub water use in the low Arctic. This will help clarify the role of water availability in recent shrub expansion as well as the degree to which tall tundra shrubs will enhance evapotranspirative water loss in these systems."
